values ('g912-v1', 'g9_12', $bank${"version":"g912-v1","set_kind":"g9_12","approved_at":"2026-11-19","source":"Wired_Quiz_Grades9-12_Question_Set.md","weights":{"scenario":0.5,"frequency":0.5},"instructions":"Think about your teen over the past month. For each moment, pick the ONE answer that sounds most like your teen right now, even if more than one fits. There are no wrong answers: every choice is a strength.","frequency_stem":"In the past month, how often does your teen...","scale":{"points":5,"labels":["Rarely","Sometimes","Often","Very often","Constantly"]},"scenarios":[{"id":"g912-s01","prompt":"A free evening all to themselves. Your teen is most likely to...","options":[{"id":"g912-s01-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"read, write, or work on an essay, story or blog"},{"id":"g912-s01-b","domain":"organizer","text":"work on a strategy game, a coding project or a logic puzzle"},{"id":"g912-s01-c","domain":"designer","text":"draw, edit photos or video, or redo their space"}]},{"id":"g912-s02","prompt":"In a group (co-op class, youth group, a team), your teen shines when...","options":[{"id":"g912-s02-a","domain":"maker","text":"there is something physical to do: build, play, compete"},{"id":"g912-s02-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"there is music: worship team, choir or a band"},{"id":"g912-s02-c","domain":"connector","text":"they can lead, encourage, or pull the group together"}]},{"id":"g912-s03","prompt":"On a hike or camping trip, your teen...","options":[{"id":"g912-s03-a","domain":"ponderer","text":"likes to hang back and have some quiet time alone"},{"id":"g912-s03-b","domain":"cultivator","text":"knows, or wants to know, the plants, birds and trees"},{"id":"g912-s03-c","domain":"seeker","text":"ends up in deep talks about God, creation or purpose"}]},{"id":"g912-s04","prompt":"When your teen is stressed, they usually...","options":[{"id":"g912-s04-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"talk it out, or write it down"},{"id":"g912-s04-b","domain":"maker","text":"work it off: exercise, build, cook or fix something"},{"id":"g912-s04-c","domain":"ponderer","text":"pull back for a while to think it through alone"}]},{"id":"g912-s05","prompt":"Planning a family trip, your teen is the one who...","options":[{"id":"g912-s05-a","domain":"organizer","text":"builds the schedule, the budget or the packing list"},{"id":"g912-s05-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"makes the playlist for the drive"},{"id":"g912-s05-c","domain":"cultivator","text":"finds the trails, parks, farms or wildlife to see"}]},{"id":"g912-s06","prompt":"At church or youth group, your teen is most drawn to...","options":[{"id":"g912-s06-a","domain":"designer","text":"the creative side: slides, stage design, photos or art"},{"id":"g912-s06-b","domain":"connector","text":"the people: mentoring younger kids or talking with adults"},{"id":"g912-s06-c","domain":"seeker","text":"the teaching, and wrestling with hard questions afterward"}]},{"id":"g912-s07","prompt":"Late at night, your teen is most likely to...","options":[{"id":"g912-s07-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"be reading, writing, or deep in a good story"},{"id":"g912-s07-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"be listening to, playing, or writing music"},{"id":"g912-s07-c","domain":"seeker","text":"want to talk about faith, meaning, or what is right"}]},{"id":"g912-s08","prompt":"In a group project, your teen naturally...","options":[{"id":"g912-s08-a","domain":"organizer","text":"sets up the plan, the numbers or the system"},{"id":"g912-s08-b","domain":"connector","text":"keeps everyone working together and feeling heard"},{"id":"g912-s08-c","domain":"ponderer","text":"takes one piece and does it on their own"}]},{"id":"g912-s09","prompt":"Your teen's dream summer job or project would be...","options":[{"id":"g912-s09-a","domain":"designer","text":"something creative: design, photos or decorating"},{"id":"g912-s09-b","domain":"maker","text":"something hands-on: building, repairing, cooking or a trade"},{"id":"g912-s09-c","domain":"cultivator","text":"something outdoors: a farm, a vet clinic or a park"}]},{"id":"g912-s10","prompt":"With friends, your teen is usually the one who...","options":[{"id":"g912-s10-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"tells the stories everyone remembers"},{"id":"g912-s10-b","domain":"connector","text":"notices who is left out and pulls them in"},{"id":"g912-s10-c","domain":"cultivator","text":"gets everyone outside: hiking, fishing or caring for animals"}]},{"id":"g912-s11","prompt":"Faced with a hard problem, your teen...","options":[{"id":"g912-s11-a","domain":"organizer","text":"breaks it down logically, step by step"},{"id":"g912-s11-b","domain":"maker","text":"tries things with their hands until something works"},{"id":"g912-s11-c","domain":"seeker","text":"asks what the right thing to do is, and why"}]},{"id":"g912-s12","prompt":"Given an hour alone, your teen is most likely to...","options":[{"id":"g912-s12-a","domain":"designer","text":"sketch, design, or build something detailed"},{"id":"g912-s12-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"practice an instrument, sing, or write a song"},{"id":"g912-s12-c","domain":"ponderer","text":"journal, reflect, or set goals for themselves"}]}],"frequency":[{"id":"g912-f01","domain":"storyteller","text":"read, write, or play with words for fun"},{"id":"g912-f02","domain":"organizer","text":"enjoy puzzles, numbers, logic, or figuring out how things work"},{"id":"g912-f03","domain":"designer","text":"draw, design, or picture how something will look before making it"},{"id":"g912-f04","domain":"maker","text":"build, fix, cook, or make things with their hands"},{"id":"g912-f05","domain":"psalmist","text":"sing, play music, or notice sounds and rhythms"},{"id":"g912-f06","domain":"connector","text":"help, lead, or encourage the people around them"},{"id":"g912-f07","domain":"ponderer","text":"want time alone to think or set their own goals"},{"id":"g912-f08","domain":"cultivator","text":"care for or explore plants, animals and the outdoors"},{"id":"g912-f09","domain":"seeker","text":"ask big questions about God, purpose, or right and wrong"}]}$bank$::jsonb, true, '2026-11-19T12:00:00Z')
on conflict (version) do nothing;

insert into public.wired_question_banks (version, set_kind, bank, active, approved_at)
values ('teen-v1', 'teen', $bank${"version":"teen-v1","set_kind":"teen","approved_at":"2026-11-19","source":"Wired_Quiz_Teen_Question_Set.md","weights":{"scenario":0.5,"frequency":0.5},"intro":"Your mom took a short quiz about how God wired you, and she'd love to see it from your side too. This isn't a test, and there are no right answers. Take it on your own and answer for you. It takes about 5 minutes. Your answers show next to hers, and it's normal if they don't match: you each see different sides of you.","instructions":"Think about yourself over the past month. For each moment, pick the ONE answer that sounds most like you right now, even if more than one fits. There are no wrong answers: every choice is a strength.","frequency_stem":"In the past month, how often do you...","scale":{"points":5,"labels":["Rarely","Sometimes","Often","Very often","Constantly"]},"scenarios":[{"id":"teen-s01","prompt":"A free evening all to yourself. You are most likely to...","options":[{"id":"teen-s01-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"read, write, or work on an essay, story or blog"},{"id":"teen-s01-b","domain":"organizer","text":"work on a strategy game, a coding project or a logic puzzle"},{"id":"teen-s01-c","domain":"designer","text":"draw, edit photos or video, or redo your space"}]},{"id":"teen-s02","prompt":"In a group (co-op class, youth group, a team), you shine when...","options":[{"id":"teen-s02-a","domain":"maker","text":"there is something physical to do: build, play, compete"},{"id":"teen-s02-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"there is music: worship team, choir or a band"},{"id":"teen-s02-c","domain":"connector","text":"you can lead, encourage, or pull the group together"}]},{"id":"teen-s03","prompt":"On a hike or camping trip, you...","options":[{"id":"teen-s03-a","domain":"ponderer","text":"like to hang back and have some quiet time alone"},{"id":"teen-s03-b","domain":"cultivator","text":"know, or want to know, the plants, birds and trees"},{"id":"teen-s03-c","domain":"seeker","text":"end up in deep talks about God, creation or purpose"}]},{"id":"teen-s04","prompt":"When you are stressed, you usually...","options":[{"id":"teen-s04-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"talk it out, or write it down"},{"id":"teen-s04-b","domain":"maker","text":"work it off: exercise, build, cook or fix something"},{"id":"teen-s04-c","domain":"ponderer","text":"pull back for a while to think it through alone"}]},{"id":"teen-s05","prompt":"Planning a family trip, you are the one who...","options":[{"id":"teen-s05-a","domain":"organizer","text":"builds the schedule, the budget or the packing list"},{"id":"teen-s05-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"makes the playlist for the drive"},{"id":"teen-s05-c","domain":"cultivator","text":"finds the trails, parks, farms or wildlife to see"}]},{"id":"teen-s06","prompt":"At church or youth group, you are most drawn to...","options":[{"id":"teen-s06-a","domain":"designer","text":"the creative side: slides, stage design, photos or art"},{"id":"teen-s06-b","domain":"connector","text":"the people: mentoring younger kids or talking with adults"},{"id":"teen-s06-c","domain":"seeker","text":"the teaching, and wrestling with hard questions afterward"}]},{"id":"teen-s07","prompt":"Late at night, you are most likely to...","options":[{"id":"teen-s07-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"be reading, writing, or deep in a good story"},{"id":"teen-s07-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"be listening to, playing, or writing music"},{"id":"teen-s07-c","domain":"seeker","text":"want to talk about faith, meaning, or what is right"}]},{"id":"teen-s08","prompt":"In a group project, you naturally...","options":[{"id":"teen-s08-a","domain":"organizer","text":"set up the plan, the numbers or the system"},{"id":"teen-s08-b","domain":"connector","text":"keep everyone working together and feeling heard"},{"id":"teen-s08-c","domain":"ponderer","text":"take one piece and do it on your own"}]},{"id":"teen-s09","prompt":"Your dream summer job or project would be...","options":[{"id":"teen-s09-a","domain":"designer","text":"something creative: design, photos or decorating"},{"id":"teen-s09-b","domain":"maker","text":"something hands-on: building, repairing, cooking or a trade"},{"id":"teen-s09-c","domain":"cultivator","text":"something outdoors: a farm, a vet clinic or a park"}]},{"id":"teen-s10","prompt":"With friends, you are usually the one who...","options":[{"id":"teen-s10-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"tells the stories everyone remembers"},{"id":"teen-s10-b","domain":"connector","text":"notices who is left out and pulls them in"},{"id":"teen-s10-c","domain":"cultivator","text":"gets everyone outside: hiking, fishing or caring for animals"}]},{"id":"teen-s11","prompt":"Faced with a hard problem, you...","options":[{"id":"teen-s11-a","domain":"organizer","text":"break it down logically, step by step"},{"id":"teen-s11-b","domain":"maker","text":"try things with your hands until something works"},{"id":"teen-s11-c","domain":"seeker","text":"ask what the right thing to do is, and why"}]},{"id":"teen-s12","prompt":"Given an hour alone, you are most likely to...","options":[{"id":"teen-s12-a","domain":"designer","text":"sketch, design, or build something detailed"},{"id":"teen-s12-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"practice an instrument, sing, or write a song"},{"id":"teen-s12-c","domain":"ponderer","text":"journal, reflect, or set goals for yourself"}]}],"frequency":[{"id":"teen-f01","domain":"storyteller","text":"read, write, or play with words for fun"},{"id":"teen-f02","domain":"organizer","text":"enjoy puzzles, numbers, logic, or figuring out how things work"},{"id":"teen-f03","domain":"designer","text":"draw, design, or picture how something will look before making it"},{"id":"teen-f04","domain":"maker","text":"build, fix, cook, or make things with your hands"},{"id":"teen-f05","domain":"psalmist","text":"sing, play music, or notice sounds and rhythms"},{"id":"teen-f06","domain":"connector","text":"help, lead, or encourage the people around you"},{"id":"teen-f07","domain":"ponderer","text":"want time alone to think or set your own goals"},{"id":"teen-f08","domain":"cultivator","text":"care for or explore plants, animals and the outdoors"},{"id":"teen-f09","domain":"seeker","text":"ask big questions about God, purpose, or right and wrong"}]}$bank$::jsonb, true, '2026-11-19T12:00:00Z')
on conflict (version) do nothing;

insert into public.wired_question_banks (version, set_kind, bank, active, approved_at)
values ('adult-v1', 'adult', $bank${"version":"adult-v1","set_kind":"adult","approved_at":"2026-11-19","source":"Wired_Quiz_Mom_Set.md","weights":{"scenario":0.5,"frequency":0.5},"instructions":"This part is about you, not your child. Think about yourself over the past month. For each moment, pick the ONE answer that sounds most like you right now, even if more than one fits. There are no wrong answers: every choice is a strength.","frequency_stem":"In the past month, how often do you...","scale":{"points":5,"labels":["Rarely","Sometimes","Often","Very often","Constantly"]},"scenarios":[{"id":"adult-s01","prompt":"A free hour all to yourself. You are most likely to...","options":[{"id":"adult-s01-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"read, or write something: a letter, a blog, a story"},{"id":"adult-s01-b","domain":"organizer","text":"plan, budget, or work on a puzzle"},{"id":"adult-s01-c","domain":"designer","text":"rearrange a room, sketch, or plan how a space could look"}]},{"id":"adult-s02","prompt":"At a church event, you are happiest...","options":[{"id":"adult-s02-a","domain":"maker","text":"in the kitchen or setting up, with your hands busy"},{"id":"adult-s02-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"singing, or helping with the music"},{"id":"adult-s02-c","domain":"connector","text":"greeting people and making new families feel at home"}]},{"id":"adult-s03","prompt":"On a walk by yourself, you...","options":[{"id":"adult-s03-a","domain":"ponderer","text":"sort through your own thoughts and plans"},{"id":"adult-s03-b","domain":"cultivator","text":"notice the birds, the plants and the weather changing"},{"id":"adult-s03-c","domain":"seeker","text":"think about life's big questions and God's purposes"}]},{"id":"adult-s04","prompt":"When you have a problem to work out, you...","options":[{"id":"adult-s04-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"talk it through, or write it all down"},{"id":"adult-s04-b","domain":"maker","text":"keep busy: clean, cook, or work with your hands while you think"},{"id":"adult-s04-c","domain":"ponderer","text":"need quiet time alone before you decide"}]},{"id":"adult-s05","prompt":"On a long drive, you...","options":[{"id":"adult-s05-a","domain":"organizer","text":"plan the stops, watch the time, or run through your to-do list"},{"id":"adult-s05-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"turn up the music and sing along"},{"id":"adult-s05-c","domain":"cultivator","text":"watch the fields, trees and animals go by"}]},{"id":"adult-s06","prompt":"Planning a family celebration, the part you love most is...","options":[{"id":"adult-s06-a","domain":"designer","text":"how it looks: the table, the colors, the decorations"},{"id":"adult-s06-b","domain":"connector","text":"who comes, and making sure everyone feels welcome"},{"id":"adult-s06-c","domain":"seeker","text":"what it means: the story or the blessing behind it"}]},{"id":"adult-s07","prompt":"In your quiet time with the Lord, you are most drawn to...","options":[{"id":"adult-s07-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"reading, and the words of Scripture themselves"},{"id":"adult-s07-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"worship music, hymns, or singing"},{"id":"adult-s07-c","domain":"seeker","text":"wrestling with hard questions and what they mean for your life"}]},{"id":"adult-s08","prompt":"When you volunteer, you would rather...","options":[{"id":"adult-s08-a","domain":"organizer","text":"run the schedule, the sign-ups or the money"},{"id":"adult-s08-b","domain":"connector","text":"be with the people: welcoming, teaching, encouraging"},{"id":"adult-s08-c","domain":"ponderer","text":"take a task you can do quietly on your own"}]},{"id":"adult-s09","prompt":"With a free Saturday, you would most enjoy...","options":[{"id":"adult-s09-a","domain":"designer","text":"a design project: a room makeover, a photo album, a sketch"},{"id":"adult-s09-b","domain":"maker","text":"building, sewing, baking, or fixing something"},{"id":"adult-s09-c","domain":"cultivator","text":"working in the garden or caring for animals"}]},{"id":"adult-s10","prompt":"With friends, you are usually the one who...","options":[{"id":"adult-s10-a","domain":"storyteller","text":"tells the stories that get everyone laughing"},{"id":"adult-s10-b","domain":"connector","text":"remembers what everyone is going through and checks in"},{"id":"adult-s10-c","domain":"cultivator","text":"suggests getting outside: a hike, a farm, the park"}]},{"id":"adult-s11","prompt":"Starting something new, like a homeschool year, you...","options":[{"id":"adult-s11-a","domain":"organizer","text":"make the plan, the calendar and the lists first"},{"id":"adult-s11-b","domain":"maker","text":"dive in and figure it out by doing"},{"id":"adult-s11-c","domain":"seeker","text":"start with why: who you hope your children become"}]},{"id":"adult-s12","prompt":"When you need to recharge, you...","options":[{"id":"adult-s12-a","domain":"designer","text":"make something beautiful: arrange, draw, or decorate"},{"id":"adult-s12-b","domain":"psalmist","text":"put on music, or play or sing"},{"id":"adult-s12-c","domain":"ponderer","text":"get time alone to think, journal or reflect"}]}],"frequency":[{"id":"adult-f01","domain":"storyteller","text":"read, write, or enjoy playing with words"},{"id":"adult-f02","domain":"organizer","text":"plan, budget, or work through a problem step by step"},{"id":"adult-f03","domain":"designer","text":"picture how something will look before you make or change it"},{"id":"adult-f04","domain":"maker","text":"make, fix, cook, or build things with your hands"},{"id":"adult-f05","domain":"psalmist","text":"have music on, sing, or play an instrument"},{"id":"adult-f06","domain":"connector","text":"reach out to encourage, host, or help people"},{"id":"adult-f07","domain":"ponderer","text":"need time alone to think things through"},{"id":"adult-f08","domain":"cultivator","text":"spend time outdoors, in the garden, or with animals"},{"id":"adult-f09","domain":"seeker","text":"think about big questions of faith, purpose, or right and wrong"}],"teaching_style":{"instructions":"For each line, tap the spot that sounds most like you right now. There are no right answers: every homeschool runs a little differently.","scale":{"points":5,"labels":["Much more like the left","A bit more like the left","Somewhere in between","A bit more like the right","Much more like the right"]},"bands":{"left_max":30,"right_min":70},"dimensions":[{"key":"structure","left":"leans toward a steady routine","right":"leans toward going with the flow","items":[{"id":"ts-st1","stem":"Our school days...","left":"follow the same routine most days","right":"look different from day to day"},{"id":"ts-st2","stem":"For tomorrow's lessons, I like...","left":"knowing exactly what we'll cover","right":"seeing where the day takes us"},{"id":"ts-st3","stem":"When something more interesting comes up mid-lesson, I usually...","left":"note it for later and keep going","right":"set the plan aside and follow it"}]},{"key":"planning","left":"leans toward planning ahead","right":"leans toward deciding in the moment","items":[{"id":"ts-pl1","stem":"I usually plan our lessons...","left":"a week or more ahead","right":"the morning of, or as we go"},{"id":"ts-pl2","stem":"Starting a school day without a plan feels...","left":"like something is missing","right":"perfectly fine"},{"id":"ts-pl3","stem":"Our best lessons tend to come from...","left":"careful preparation","right":"ideas on the spot"}]},{"key":"capacity","left":"has room to spare right now","right":"is running close to empty right now","items":[{"id":"ts-ca1","stem":"Most days, I have...","left":"the energy to teach the way I want","right":"less energy than teaching takes"},{"id":"ts-ca2","stem":"By early afternoon, I usually...","left":"still have plenty left","right":"feel worn out"},{"id":"ts-ca3","stem":"Keeping more than one child's lessons going at once feels...","left":"doable","right":"like a lot right now"}]},{"key":"resistance","left":"leans toward finding another way in","right":"leans toward steady follow-through","items":[{"id":"ts-re1","stem":"When my child pushes back on a lesson, I usually...","left":"look for another way to teach it","right":"keep the expectation and help them finish"},{"id":"ts-re2","stem":"Choices about what or how to learn...","left":"I offer my child often","right":"I mostly make, and explain why"},{"id":"ts-re3","stem":"When my child is frustrated, I usually...","left":"pause and talk about how they feel","right":"encourage them to push through"}]}]}}$bank$::jsonb, true, '2026-11-19T12:00:00Z')
on conflict (version) do nothing;
